            "reviewer_id": "User_14000538_1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Dong Trieu - The Old Fashioned Bar",
            "review_text": "Troy N\n7 contributions\n0\nOur favourite bar in HCM City\nMay 2019 • Friends\nWe could see the sign for Dong Trieu across the street from our Rex Hotel balcony, so we decided to check it out. Getting there was an adventure... Someone pointed us down a narrow dark alley, then we had to enter through the back of a clothing store under renovation and take an elevator to the second floor. This was just the beginning. Going to this hidden gem of a bar is like entering a David Lynch movie, without the foreboding sense of danger. The cocktails are intricately crafted and are served on a tiny silver platter. The barman, who goes by Ryan for Westerners, is just amazing. We went there three nights in a row because we couldn't get enough of the vibe.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
