            "review_text": "John B\n34 contributions\n0\nGreat speakeasy in Ho Chi Minh City\nNov 2018 • Friends\nRyan is an amazing owner and host of this cozy speakeasy bar in HCMC. We came here for the last night of our honeymoon and the cocktails were GREAT! Def come if you want an easy place to chill. Follow the signs outside as it's not the most obvious place to get to!\nWritten November 21, 2018",
